{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんたーん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋でのスペシャル公演と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似顔絵回お疲れ様でした❣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2014/11/27/9931931/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わざわざ東京から名古屋に足を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"運んでくださったりさ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋での乃木坂のライブを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ち望んでいてくれている人が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いるって思うだけでとっても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいんです♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、紅白には出られなく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なってしまったからこそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その結果が分かってからの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初ライブだったので何か気合いが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"入ってました(´°ω°`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー皆、なんとなく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういう雰囲気だったと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「乃木坂やってやろうーぜ！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みたいなあえて言葉に書くなら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この言葉が1番しっくりくるかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また次からもっともっと頑張って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年もし出れたら乃木坂って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと早く出て欲しかったね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってもらえるように✟"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年から頑張ります♡♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、今日のライブは本当に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"para